\"proof_sketch\",\"result_type\":\"proposed_result\",\"smallest_independent_check\":\"In an environment containing the repository's pinned Lean toolchain, place only the proposed body in a temporary copy of `359.lean`, run `lake --wfail build 'FormalConjectures.ErdosProblems.«359»'`, then run `#print axioms Erdos359.erdos_359.variants.isGoodFor_1_low_values` and confirm that `sorryAx` is absent.\"}"}}
